  "description": "bit Bmage: image processing from strongly typed C#, headless and browser-independent, for ASP.NET Core, console, worker and Blazor hosts alike. Pixel buffers, transforms, adjustments, filters, drawing, annotations, masks and selective edits, image, fill and adjustment layers with W3C blend modes, EXIF metadata, managed PNG/JPEG/BMP/GIF codecs, a managed WebP codec, lossy and lossless, and a managed AVIF decoder, none needing a native library, composable non-destructive pipelines and edits that save to JSON and replay on a server, spread over as many cores as you allow with identical pixels, with predictable, budgeted memory. Add Bit.Bmage.Blazor for the browser integration and the BmageEditor component.",
